**See it in action...**

**What is it?** It provides you with an analysis of the keyword density
that your competition has compared to your content. 

**How Does it Work?**You simply enter your content and the URL of
competing pages. Our tool then analyzes the competition and your post
showing the difference in keyword density.

As always write for your audience BUT this tool helps show if you are
not covering a part of the topic.

**Really FREE?**Yes it is 100% free... not even an email required!

**Why Did We Make It?** We will continue building tools to help writers
and editors be successful at creating content that ranks. 

We are also continually looking to help writers avoid false positives.
When they use ANY AI writing assistant it increases the chances of a
false positive. Our content optimizer, unlike the premium alternatives,
does not use AI. 

 

